t=650: WF1 Round 0→1 transition (8 trials done, need 6 trials now)
  - Available time: (3600-650) × 0.7 = 2065s
  - Available budget: (50-0.52) × 0.6 = $29.69
  - Current: 4 instances
  - Check: Can 2 instances handle 6 trials in 2065s?
    * trials_per_instance = 3
    * runtime = 3 × 100s = 300s < 2065s ✓
    * min_needed = 6/3 = 2 instances
  - Decision: FREE 2 on-demand g4dn instances
