2. Cloud Reserved (if on-prem insufficient)
3. Cloud On-Demand (if budget allows) → Lock to cloud cluster

MOLDABLE SCALING (On-Prem Workflows):
1. Additional on-prem instances (same cluster only)

MOLDABLE SCALING (Cloud Workflows):
1. Cloud Reserved instances (cheaper)
2. Cloud On-Demand instances (if budget allows and speedup justified)

MOLDABLE FREEING (LIFO):
1. Free from end of instances list (most recent)
2. Typically frees on-demand first (allocated last)
3. Then reserved (allocated earlier)

================================================================================
END OF ON-PREMISE IMPLEMENTATION
